  <bpmn:process id="chess-process" name="Chess, against the house" isExecutable="false">
    <bpmn:documentation>Everybody on /chess: anybody, signed in or not, plays the city's game against the house; a member also queues to play the house one on one or challenges another member; the house is the owner's account, playing every game from the same page with a different face.</bpmn:documentation>
